`an acquisition that lessens competition` MEANS Merger WITH
    `is a merger under section 54(2)` IS TRUE
    `acquirer is a receiver, liquidator or underwriter acting as such` IS FALSE
    `all parties are under common control` IS FALSE
    `control passed solely by will, intestacy or survivorship` IS FALSE
    `acquirer is a securities dealer holding temporarily` IS FALSE
    `dealer votes only to arrange disposal` IS FALSE
    `months the dealer has held control` IS 0
    `longer period in months set by the Commission` IS 0
    `substantially lessens competition in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `approved by a Minister or regulator under written law` IS FALSE
    `that approval was under section 19 of the Significant Investments Review Act 2024` IS FALSE
    `approved by the Monetary Authority of Singapore` IS FALSE
    `within another regulator's competition jurisdiction` IS FALSE
    `involves a specified-activity undertaking` IS FALSE
    `efficiencies outweigh the adverse effects` IS FALSE

